[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4981.669, "timestamp": "01:23:01", "text": "こんにちは、コンテンツ。 閉じるボタン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4986.07, "timestamp": "01:23:06", "text": "ああ、テキストを入れただけなのに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4989.91, "timestamp": "01:23:09", "text": "背景が付いてる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4992.79, "timestamp": "01:23:12", "text": "でも待って、それではどうやってテキストが表示されているの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4994.55, "timestamp": "01:23:14", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4996.95, "timestamp": "01:23:16", "text": "私がそのポジションを設定したか？   私は何もしていません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5000.47, "timestamp": "01:23:20", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5002.95, "timestamp": "01:23:22", "text": "はぁ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5005.75, "timestamp": "01:23:25", "text": "待てよ、それはおかしいぞ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5015.59, "timestamp": "01:23:35", "text": "それは完全な、え、何？ どうやって？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5020.229, "timestamp": "01:23:40", "text": "これはどうすればいいですか？ ちょっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.55, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5025.189, "timestamp": "01:23:45", "text": "はぁ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5026.95, "timestamp": "01:23:46", "text": "待って。 つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5033.03, "timestamp": "01:23:53", "text": "何？"}]